{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify OS 2.0 **Dynamic Product Main Section** for the Refine theme.
    
    Use the design direction of the provided reference product pages from Buzz Retail and Creative Studios Store, but keep the styling consistent with TOOSA's existing Refine theme.
    
    ### Layout
    
    * Desktop: two-column layout.
    * Left: product image gallery.
    * Right: dynamic product information.
    * Mobile: stack gallery first, product information below.
    * Use the Shopify `product` object dynamically. Do not hard-code product content.
    
    ### Product Gallery
    
    * Display all product media dynamically.
    * Large main product image with thumbnail navigation.
    * Support images and product videos.
    * Thumbnail slider/navigation.
    * Image zoom/lightbox.
    * Responsive image sizing and lazy loading.
    * Maintain proper image aspect ratio without distortion.
    
    ### Product Information
    
    Dynamically display:
    
    * Product title
    * Vendor
    * SKU
    * Star rating/review area if available
    * Current price
    * Compare-at price
    * Sale/discount badge
    * Product description summary
    * Variant selectors
    * Quantity selector
    * Add to Cart button
    * Buy Now button if supported by the theme
    * Availability/inventory status
    * Pickup/shipping information when available
    * Dynamic payment/financing information where supported
    
    ### Refine Theme Compatibility
    
    * Reuse existing Refine theme typography, buttons, colors, spacing and product settings wherever possible.
    * Do not break existing variant selection, cart, inventory or Shopify product functionality.
    * Use Shopify Liquid, CSS and vanilla JavaScript.
    * No external libraries.
    * Make all layout/spacing/image settings configurable from the Theme Editor.
    * Fully responsive and mobile-first.
    * Keep the design premium, clean and suitable for TOOSA's industrial/tool-storage products.
    , Liquid error (temp/ai_gen_block_d99d98c line 584): Invalid form type "abulhmjljnzhuk05tbaigenblockd99d98cg9w8h4", must be one of ["product", "storefront_password", "contact", "customer_login", "create_customer", "recover_customer_password", "reset_customer_password", "guest_login", "currency", "activate_customer_password", "customer_address", "new_comment", "customer", "localization", "cart"], add short description in right side in accordion and quatity selector not lookin good , image thumbanail clicking loading issue, left side image stop and right slide scroll
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-product-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }
 {% comment %} @media screen and (min-width: 1400px) {
  .ai-product-main-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
} {% endcomment %}
 @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
  .ai-product-main-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;
  }

 
    .ai-product-main-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: {{ block.settings.gallery_width }}% {{ 100 | minus: block.settings.gallery_width }}%;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .ai-product-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-product-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      position: sticky;
      top: 20px;
    }
  }

  .ai-product-main-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.thumbnail_spacing }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-product-main-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img,
  .ai-product-main-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} video {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: {{ block.settings.image_aspect_ratio }};
    object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_fit }};
  }

  .ai-product-thumbnails-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.thumbnail_spacing }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
  }

  .ai-product-thumbnail-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.thumbnail_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.thumbnail_size }}px;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.thumbnail_border_radius }}px;
    cursor: pointer;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_background }};
  }

